/T (After every service/event, toys and toy structures will need to be sanitized. Spray all toys with disinfecting spray \(no bleach\) and allow to air dry. If disinfecting spray is not available, you may use disinfecting wipes \(no bleach\) to wipe down all toys and toy structures. )
/E (After every service/event, toys and toy structures will need to be sanitized. Spray all toys with disinfecting spray \(no bleach\) and allow to air dry. If disinfecting spray is not available, you may use disinfecting wipes \(no bleach\) to wipe down all toys and toy structures. )
