295 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Once a quarter, toys will need to be deep cleaned. Wash all toys in warm, soapy water. Use a brush to reach crevices. Rinse toys in clean water. Mix 1 tablespoon bleach per gallon of water to create a bleach water solution. Soak plastic and wooden toys in solution for 15 minutes. Remove toys from the bleach water and rinse well in clean water. Allow to air dry. Cloth toys should be washed in a washing machine with hot water and placed in the dryer on high.)
/E (Once a quarter, toys will need to be deep cleaned. Wash all toys in warm, soapy water. Use a brush to reach crevices. Rinse toys in clean water. Mix 1 tablespoon bleach per gallon of water to create a bleach water solution. Soak plastic and wooden toys in solution for 15 minutes. Remove toys from the bleach water and rinse well in clean water. Allow to air dry. Cloth toys should be washed in a washing machine with hot water and placed in the dryer on high.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 16 0 R
>>
